<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Apple and Pear Board sets NZ$35 mln issue - BNZ.</title>
<headline>NZ Apple and Pear Board sets NZ$35 mln issue - BNZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Apple and Pear Board has set a NZ$35 million November 15, 2002 bond issue, lead manager and underwriter Bank of New Zealand said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The board has the right to accept oversubscriptions up to NZ$40 million.</p>
<p>BNZ said the issue was offered at a spread of 0.72 percent over New Zealand government stock and settlement date was November 15. -- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
